        <lang id="de" date="20261118153954" status="3">add/link: Bereich des Textes im Bild (Pixel).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="import: removes screenshots missing in the manifest." created="20261118153954" note="Screenshots" notereadonly="1">
        <native>import: removes screenshots missing in the manifest.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261118153954" status="3">import: entfernt Screenshots, die im Manifest fehlen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Screenshots of the exported rows: auto (default) embeds them in Excel on a second\nworksheet and copies them next to other formats (&lt;name&gt;_screenshots/):" created="20261118153954" note="Screenshots" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Screenshots of the exported rows: auto (default) embeds them in Excel on a second#lworksheet and copies them next to other formats (&lt;name&gt;_screenshots/):</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261118153954" status="3">Screenshots der exportierten Zeilen: auto (Standard) bettet sie in Excel auf einem zweiten#lTabellenblatt ein und kopiert sie bei anderen Formaten daneben (&lt;Name&gt;_screenshots/):</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Unknown screenshot action '{action}' (possible: {actions})" created="20261118153954" note="Screenshots" notereadonly="1">
